 } } \right]$$, and k$$\in$$R. <br><br>If $$a_1^2$$ + $$a_2^2$$ = ${2 \over 3}$$(b$$_1^2$$ + b$$_2^2$$) and (k<sup>2</sup> + 1) b$$_2^2$$ $$\ne$$ $$-$$2b<sub>1</sub>b<sub>2</sub>, then the value of k is __________.

