questions.question:
If $$A = \left( {\matrix{
   {{1 \over {\sqrt 5 }}} &amp; {{2 \over {\sqrt 5 }}}  \cr 
   {{{ - 2} \over {\sqrt 5 }}} &amp; {{1 \over {\sqrt 5 }}}  \cr 

 } } \right)$$, $$B = \left( {\matrix{
   1 &amp; 0  \cr 
   i &amp; 1  \cr 

 } } \right)$$, $$i = \sqrt { - 1} $$, and Q = A<sup>T</sup>BA, then the inverse of the matrix A Q<sup>2021</sup> A<sup>T</sup> is equal to :

