$$A{A^T} = \left( {\matrix{
   {{1 \over {\sqrt 5 }}} &amp; {{2 \over {\sqrt 5 }}}  \cr 
   {{{ - 2} \over {\sqrt 5 }}} &amp; {{1 \over {\sqrt 5 }}}  \cr 

 } } \right)\left( {\matrix{
   {{1 \over {\sqrt 5 }}} &amp; {{{ - 2} \over {\sqrt 5 }}}  \cr 
   {{2 \over {\sqrt 5 }}} &amp; {{1 \over {\sqrt 5 }}}  \cr 

 } } \right)$$

$$A{A^T} = \left( {\matrix{
   1 &amp; 0  \cr 
   0 &amp; 1  \cr 

 } } \right) = I$$

${Q^2} = {A^T}BA\,{A^T}BA = {A^T}BIBA$$

$$ \Rightarrow {Q^2} = {A^T}{B^2}A$$

${Q^3} = {A^T}{B^2}A{A^T}BA \Rightarrow {Q^3} = {A^T}{B^3}A$$

Similarly : ${Q^{2021}} = {A^T}{B^{2021}}A$$

Now, ${B^2} = \left( {\matrix{
   1 &amp; 0  \cr 
   i &amp; 1  \cr 

 } } \right)\left( {\matrix{
   1 &amp; 0  \cr 
   i &amp; 1  \cr 

 } } \right) = \left( {\matrix{
   1 &amp; 0  \cr 
   {2i} &amp; 1  \cr 

 } } \right)$$

${B^3} = \left( {\matrix{
   1 &amp; 0  \cr 
   {2i} &amp; 1  \cr 

 } } \right)\left( {\matrix{
   1 &amp; 0  \cr 
   i &amp; 1  \cr 

 } } \right) \Rightarrow {B^3} = \left( {\matrix{
   1 &amp; 0  \cr 
   {3i} &amp; 1  \cr 

 } } \right)$$

Similarly ${B^{2021}} = \left( {\matrix{
   1 &amp; 0  \cr 
   {2021i} &amp; 1  \cr 

 } } \right)$$

$$\therefore$$ $$A{Q^{2021}} = {A^T} = A{A^T}{B^{2021}}\,A{A^T} = I{B^{2021}}I$$

$$ \Rightarrow A{Q^{2021}}\,{A^T} = {B^{2021}} = \left( {\matrix{
   1 &amp; 0  \cr 
   {2021i} &amp; 1  \cr 

 } } \right)$$

$$\therefore$$ ${(A{Q^{2021}}\,{A^T})^{ - 1}} = {\left( {\matrix{
   1 &amp; 0  \cr 
   {2021i} &amp; 1  \cr 

 } } \right)^{ - 1}} = \left( {\matrix{
   1 &amp; 0  \cr 
   { - 2021i} &amp; 1  \cr 

 } } \right)$$

