 } } \right]$$, then a + b =5

For x = 1, there exists a unit vector $$\alpha \widehat i + \beta \widehat j + \gamma \widehat k$$ for which $$R\left[ {\matrix{
   \alpha   \cr 
   \beta   \cr 
   \gamma   \cr 

 } } \right] = \left[ {\matrix{
   0  \cr 
   0  \cr 
   0  \cr 

 } } \right]$$

$$\det R = \det \left[ {\matrix{
   2 &amp; x &amp; x  \cr 
